WEBVTT

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:06.633
Scenario: deliver with three iron ingots, otherwise gather them first

00:00:06.633 --> 00:00:12.300
Connect inventory count to A; B is 3 and the comparison is &gt;=

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:18.033
The comparison feeds condition; flow wires decide when it is evaluated

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:21.067
The first grant has no iron, so only the gather route activates

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:23.967
Granting again with three ingots selects the true delivery route
